    "detailed_description": "<h1>\u26a0\ufe0f\u2757\u2757 Important Notice: Location Permission Pop-Up \u2757\u2757\u26a0\ufe0f</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hello everyone!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for your continued support! We\u2019ve recently received a few reports about a location permission pop-up appearing in our games. If you see this prompt, feel free to <strong><i><u>decline it</u></i></strong>. The game should work just fine without needing any location data. Rest assured, we haven\u2019t programmed our games to request location access.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re actively looking into what\u2019s causing this. For context, our games are built using the Construct 3 engine, which relies on HTML5 technology, and this might be related to the issue. One possibility (though we\u2019re not certain yet) is that a recent Windows update could be triggering these prompts for web-based applications.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you encounter this pop-up, we\u2019d greatly appreciate it if you could take a screenshot and send it to us at <u>ub@noobzilla.games</u>. Your help will go a long way in helping us resolve this!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for your understanding, and we apologize for any inconvenience. We truly value your support!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Best regards,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UB</p></p><br><h1>Wishlist Our Next Game ^^</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845320/extras/9b846d80537cfd83dd3d2be20ae35cf5.poster.avif?t=1751633280\" width=800 height=227 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845320/extras/9b846d80537cfd83dd3d2be20ae35cf5.webm?t=1751633280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><table><tr><th><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845320/extras/d5b96aa7444e8d06249cd74c4b986369.poster.avif?t=1751633280\" width=616 height=90 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845320/extras/d5b96aa7444e8d06249cd74c4b986369.webm?t=1751633280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845320/extras/d5b96aa7444e8d06249cd74c4b986369.mp4?t=1751633280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>This is the third title of <strong>Cats and Seek</strong> series.<br>In this third series, we will explore Kyoto and greet the cats there \ud83d\ude03<br>\ud83d\ude3b Let's play hide and seek with the cats in Kyoto! <br>\u2764\ufe0f \u200a\u200a\u200a\u200aCan you find them all? \u2764\ufe0f<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845320/extras/e54663cfb17cc2ee90c4a67b5b4f0b1d.poster.avif?t=1751633280\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845320/extras/e54663cfb17cc2ee90c4a67b5b4f0b1d.webm?t=1751633280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845320/extras/e54663cfb17cc2ee90c4a67b5b4f0b1d.mp4?t=1751633280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>New Feature : Photo and Paint Mode \ud83d\udcf7 \ud83c\udfa8<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845320/extras/0b5c8422c722bd287ad835b2651f6cf5.poster.avif?t=1751633280\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845320/extras/0b5c8422c722bd287ad835b2651f6cf5.webm?t=1751633280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845320/extras/0b5c8422c722bd287ad835b2651f6cf5.mp4?t=1751633280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>\ud83c\udfae 1 level :: \ud83d\ude3b 100 Hidden cats :: \ud83c\udfc6 Achievements<br>\ud83d\udd09 Cute cat sounds :: \ud83d\udd06 Brightness setting :: \ud83d\udd0d Zoom<br>\ud83d\udd14 Free hints :: \ud83c\udfa8 Choose your favorite color :: \ud83d\udcbe Save system<br>\ud83c\udf81 Extra Level DLC<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845320/extras/c81fa7167fdb3615313064fa52cf47ac.poster.avif?t=1751633280\" width=616 height=90 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845320/extras/c81fa7167fdb3615313064fa52cf47ac.webm?t=1751633280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845320/extras/c81fa7167fdb3615313064fa52cf47ac.mp4?t=1751633280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></th></tr></table>",
